 "structural_change": "S81-DV (owner 0cj 10-16): new leaf. Slice norm exchange: beat-partial collector, exchange ring stop (fixed hop counts, no flow control, collisions fault) and replicated golden-tree finish (ot_dsrom_su_norm vector levels verbatim, divide by D, + eps, rsqrt). Every input lands in a flop (robust first cell); no input/output hold padding (die-level hold budget at relay stations). RTL-BUILD-S81 10-18: ENG mode (mode pin, sampled with go) -- 12-vector Engram collector, slot-fill ring inject (forwards first), 4 per-copy eng_finish trees (hh/kk/dd on one adder each), e_* csum totals; NORM paths unchanged.",
